sequenceDiagram
    actor C as Candidat
    actor E as Encadrant
    participant NG as Angular
    participant CC as CandidatureController
    participant CS as CandidatureService
    participant NS as NotificationService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    C->>NG: formulaire de candidature (+ CV)
    NG->>CC: POST /api/candidatures (multipart)
    CC->>CS: soumettre(request, cv)
    CS->>DB: enregistre candidature (statut=EN_ATTENTE)
    CS->>NS: notifie RH + encadrants du departement
    NS->>DB: notifications in-app
    CS-->>NG: 201 CandidatureResponse

    E->>NG: planifie un entretien
    NG->>CC: PATCH /api/candidatures/{id}/meeting
    CC->>CS: planifierMeeting(...)
    CS->>DB: statut=MEETING_PLANIFIE
    CS-->>NG: meeting.ics (export agenda)

    E->>NG: Accepter / Refuser
    NG->>CC: PATCH /api/candidatures/{id}/decision
    alt Accepte
        CS->>DB: statut=ACCEPTEE_ENCADRANT + cree Stagiaire
        CS->>NS: notifie le candidat (accepte)
    else Refuse
        CS->>DB: suppression candidature (+CV) — libere la place
    end
    CS-->>NG: 200
